# AcornOS under Ginux. Required: OpenRC reaches the default runlevel and every
# service it lists is started, except these known gaps. Remove a line when its
# service starts (the check says so).
gap networking  needs the hostname service; sethostname is ENOSYS under Ginux
gap sshd        image files stat as the host owner, not virtual root: "/var/empty must be owned by root"
gap dhcpcd      crashes: the instance has no network
